<title>USA: Catalyst Int'l in software supply pact.</title>
<headline>Catalyst Int'l in software supply pact.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalyst International Inc said Wednesday it received a contract to provide warehouse management software to Fred's Inc.</p>
<p>Catalyst said Fred's, a general merchandise discount retailer, will use its Warehouse Management System in its 750,000-square-foot distribution center by the end of 1997.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not announced.</p>
<p>Catalyst develops and markets warehouse management software systems. Its shares were unchanged at 3-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
